1 Introduction
Our contribution
This paper makes three contributions.
(1) OmniGene-4, a unified bio-language foundation model on MoE. We build on Gemma-4-26B-A4B-Instruct [17] (30 transformer layers, 128 experts per layer, top-8 routing, ≈ 3 . 8 B
